{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>One prince per day.</b> In order to give honor to the princes — because Nachshon marched first and he offered first, so that he not say: since I offered first, I will offer together with each and every one on his day. Therefore it says <b>one prince per day. One prince per day</b> — to prolong the duration of your rejoicing."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:50.642417926Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}